      "quote": null,
      "reason": "No time frame of measurement is specified for any outcome domain; the methods only list 'follow-up duration' as an extracted data item, and follow-up windows (21-30 days) appear only as study characteristics in Table 1, not as defined measurement time points per outcome."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_10a_e3",
      "status": "MISSING",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "The manuscript nowhere states whether all results compatible with each outcome domain in each study (all measures, time points, analyses) were sought."
